# CSS standards

- **Colors:** Define only in `src/styles/variables.css` on `:root` as `--color-*`.
- **Never** use `#`, `rgb()`, `hsl()`, or color names in other CSS files.
- Non-color tokens: `src/styles/tokens.css` only (`--space-*`, `--font-*`, etc.).
- One UI block = one file in `src/styles/components/` matching BEM block name (`hero.css` → `.hero`).
- BEM: `block__element--modifier`.
- No IDs for styling.
- File header comment required (see `docs/DOCUMENTATION.md`).
- Do not scatter `@import` in component files; import via page entry in fixed order.
